'''Sobha Limited''' (formerly '''Sobha Developers Limited''') is a multinational real estate developer with its headquarters in [[Dubai]], [[United Arab Emirates]] and a corporate office in [[Bengaluru]], [[India]].<ref>{{cite news |url=http://www.moneycontrol.com/company-facts/sobhadevelopers/management/SD6 |title=Sobha Developers Company Facts  |publisher=Moneycontrol |access-date=2013-06-25}}</ref>

==History==
Sobha Realty is an international luxury developer. It was established in 1976 as an interior decoration firm in Oman by [[P. N. C. Menon]]. The company has developed and invested in projects in the [[United Arab Emirates|UAE]], [[Oman]], [[Bahrain]], [[Brunei]] and [[India]].{{cn|date=January 2026}}

Sobha Limited was founded on 7 August 1995 by [[P. N. C. Menon]].<ref>{{cite web|title=Sobha: Reports, Company History, Directors Report, Chairman's Speech, Auditors Report of SOBHA – NDTVProfit.com|url=http://profit.ndtv.com/stock/sobha-ltd_sobha/reports|website=profit.ndtv.com|publisher=NDTV Profit|access-date=27 January 2016}}</ref> The company announced an investment of {{currency|500|INR}} crore residential development in [[GIFT City]].<ref>{{Cite news|url=https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/sobha-to-invest-rs-500-cr-on-housing-project-at-gift-city/articleshow/63787633.cms|title=Sobha to invest Rs 500 cr on housing project at GIFT City – Times of India|work=The Times of India|access-date=2018-08-22}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news|url=https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/companies/sobha-forays-into-gujarat-with-rs-500-cr-investment-in-gift-city/article23560702.ece|title=Sobha forays into Gujarat with Rs 500 cr investment in GIFT City|work=@businessline|access-date=2018-08-22|language=en}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.indiatoday.in/pti-feed/story/sobha-to-invest-rs-500-cr-on-housing-project-at-gift-city-1213551-2018-04-16|title=Sobha to invest Rs 500 cr on housing project at GIFT City|website=India Today|date=16 April 2018 |language=en|access-date=2018-08-22}}</ref>

The company changed its name to "Sobha Limited" on 18 August 2014.<ref>{{cite news|title=Change in Name of the Company from "Sobha Developers Ltd" to "Sobha Ltd"|url=http://www.thehindubusinessline.com/companies/announcements/others/change-in-name-of-the-company-from-sobha-developers-ltd-to-sobha-ltd/article6331124.ece|access-date=30 September 2015|work=thehindubusinessline|agency=thehindubusinessline.com|date=19 August 2014}}</ref> Internationally, Sobha Ltd has operations running in Oman and [[Dubai]]<ref>{{cite news |url=http://www.khaleejtimes.com/biz/inside.asp?xfile=/data/business/2012/February/business_February99.xml&section=business |title=Sobha city Project |publisher=khaleej Times |access-date=2012-02-06}}</ref><ref>{{cite news |url=https://gulfnews.com/business/property/international/india-s-sobha-developers-to-inject-dh11b-in-meydan-1.1084244|title=India's Sobha Developers Meydan Dubai Project|publisher=Gulf News |access-date=2013-06-29}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|title=Sobha Ltd Q3 profit rises marginally|url=https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/companies/sobha-ltd-q3-profit-rises-marginally/article6887695.ece|access-date=18 February 2015|date=12 February 2015}}</ref> as '''Sobha Realty'''.

